---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Airwalk — Free Voice Chat" description="Terms of Service for Airwalk voice and text chat platform. Read our rules, user responsibilities, and community standards.">
	<header class="bg-canvas/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-hairline h-14 flex items-center justify-between px-4 md:px-8 sticky top-0 z-40">
		<a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-ink">
			<svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z"/></svg>
			<span class="font-extrabold text-lg uppercase">Airwalk</span>
		</a>
		<a href="/chat" class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary-deep text-on-primary font-semibold text-sm py-2 px-5 rounded-lg transition-colors">Start Chatting</a>
	</header>

	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink">Terms of Service</h1>
		<p class="text-sm text-steel">Last updated: June 12, 2025</p>

		<div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-6 text-slate text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
				<p>By accessing or using Airwalk (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the Service. Airwalk is operated from Uttar Pradesh, India.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">2. Eligibility</h2>
				<p>You must be at least 13 years of age to use Airwalk. If you are between 13 and 18, you should use the Service with parental awareness. By using the Service, you represent that you meet the age requirement.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">3. Description of Service</h2>
				<p>Airwalk provides a free, anonymous voice and text chat platform that connects users randomly based on shared interests, language, and country preferences. The Service includes:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
					<li>Voice chat (peer-to-peer audio)</li>
					<li>Text messaging during calls</li>
					<li>In-call mini-games</li>
					<li>Interest-based matching</li>
					<li>Friends system</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">4. User Conduct</h2>
				<p>You agree NOT to:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
					<li>Harass, bully, threaten, or abuse other users</li>
					<li>Share sexually explicit, violent, or illegal content</li>
					<li>Impersonate another person or entity</li>
					<li>Attempt to collect personal information from other users</li>
					<li>Use bots, scripts, or automated tools to manipulate the Service</li>
					<li>Promote hate speech, discrimination, or violence against any group</li>
					<li>Share malware, phishing links, or harmful content</li>
					<li>Record other users without their explicit consent</li>
					<li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose under Indian law</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">5. The 5-Second Rule</h2>
				<p>Airwalk implements a 5-second cooldown on the skip button to prevent spam and bot activity. This feature is integral to maintaining conversation quality and cannot be circumvented.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">6. Reporting & Moderation</h2>
				<p>Users can report or block other users for violations. We reserve the right to take action including temporary or permanent bans based on reports. While we strive to maintain a safe environment, we cannot guarantee moderation of all real-time conversations.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
				<p>All content, design, logos, and code of the Airwalk platform are the intellectual property of Airwalk. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or reverse-engineer any part of the Service without written permission.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">8. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
				<p>The Service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee uninterrupted access, error-free operation, or that other users will behave appropriately. Use the Service at your own risk.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
				<p>To the maximum extent permitted by Indian law, Airwalk shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Service, including but not limited to emotional distress caused by interactions with other users.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">10. Governing Law</h2>
				<p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Uttar Pradesh, India.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">11. Changes to Terms</h2>
				<p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be posted on this page. Your continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">12. Contact</h2>
				<p>For questions about these Terms, contact us at: <strong>contact@airwalk.live</strong></p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<footer class="border-t border-hairline py-8 px-4 text-center text-xs text-steel">
		<p>© 2025 Airwalk. All rights reserved. <a href="/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Home</a> · <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline">Privacy</a> · <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:underline">Contact</a></p>
	</footer>
</Layout>
